{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_title", "source_sha256": "3ae010fd88f5aaebf6333fea7f8be73e214c63f62d3f9386af30938cc6168258", "ja": "またいつもの日常へ", "zh": "回到往常的每一天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c820195d63d39bb46bcb674020e93c634f96b7c3c48638f4b29f7d0b3cf5e7f3", "ja": "劇場に到着した伊織、美也、歌織、桃子、\n未来。明日起きれるか不安な未来だが、\n起きないとお土産が渡せないとの桃子の\n言葉に、気合いが入る。ふたりの抜群の\nチームワークに、他のみんなは微笑んだ。", "zh": "伊织、美也、歌织、桃子、未来抵达剧场。未来担心自己明天能不能起得来，但听到桃子说要是不起来就没法把伴手礼交给大家后，便打起了精神。看到两人无与伦比的团队合作，其他人都露出了微笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "62c758e7c9431ebfd7ad0d7bba6a75c450569880774f60091f8fb36ccad6333d", "ja": "（南エリアの最終公演を終え、劇場に到着した。\n地方との往復の日々は、これで一段落だな）", "zh": "（结束南部地区的最终公演后，回到了剧场。往返各地的日子，到这里总算告一段落了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "c12ab12e7b7b9f741951e90ff7d3c4050e418e7d38bfd9d2e082263567d0f029", "ja": "お～、戻ってきましたよ～。\nやはり劇場は、ほっとしますな～。", "zh": "哦～我们回来啦～剧场果然让人安心呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "a2cf22f8c4664752e361a794b128cbcbced1216793ed9d946f359984bd1ef65c", "ja": "桃子も。旅行から家に帰ってくる時って、\nこんな感じなのかな……。", "zh": "桃子也是。旅行结束回到家时，大概就是这种感觉吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "ef33147810bc2321f438eaf0a94a77f3dba56e38c6ba7d54ed8d3c829cb46895", "ja": "せめてビジネスくらい用意しなさいよね。\n機内が狭くて疲れちゃったわ。", "zh": "至少也该准备商务舱吧。\n机舱里太挤了，累死我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "f8da639c73cc09c64c4e59be7bf0684fa7a72acd40c42b2fc523f840602058cb", "ja": "ふふっ。みんなとおしゃべりしながら\n移動するのも、新鮮で楽しかったわ。", "zh": "呵呵，能和大家一边聊天一边赶路，也觉得很新鲜、很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2b169a3cd9d311ba2c5178e2e6553e4bdd6ab8894461398b4bf7b8af6eec98c8", "ja": "公演に移動で、みんな疲れただろ。\nすぐに送っていくからな。", "zh": "去演出场地的路上，大家都累了吧。\n我马上送大家回去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "d44e0dd88c258d76eed12d1a50c9027ef2b576ad5b323dd557d83df4a77763f6", "ja": "みんなでお茶でも……と言いたいところですが、\n時間も遅いですしね～。また明日にしましょう～。", "zh": "虽然很想说大家一起去喝杯茶什么的……\n不过时间也晚了呢～。还是明天再说吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "1a08f6819ee17101860c5086e0c6034f6f03c85ef0d1ecd81b4cb993f4dfccd0", "ja": "は～い。楽しかった南エリアのツアーも、\n今日でおしまいなんですね……。", "zh": "好～的。在南部地区度过的愉快巡演，今天就要结束了呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "aa8583565f3bcbe47d650fb779b05527dafb2d62458ab5cae072a7ca796d6b39", "ja": "だからって気を抜かないようにね、未来。\n明日のミーティング、遅刻しても知らないんだから。", "zh": "不过也不能因此松懈哦，未来。\n明天的会议要是迟到了，我可不管你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "b2e7136c4a9b4c353779ca42b3edc69449f3763a2a2323309093eeb3275f0fe9", "ja": "そうね。他のみんなが地方公演に出かけている間は、\n私たちが、劇場でがんばらないと……。", "zh": "是啊。在其他人去外地演出期间，\n我们也得在剧场里加油才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "a6e98b0827e47ed3e2c8ce1a7fe0cc7330ee71c0000613d7c66175ee3c7a3e15", "ja": "も、もちろんわかってますよ！\nでも、明日……目覚ましで起きられるかな～……。", "zh": "当、当然明白啦！\n不过，明天……我能靠闹钟起床吗～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "6e577058ecb43707ce001619a74bf57bdd0c021be12a9d506d6d78d8b6990f54", "ja": "ちゃんと起きなくちゃダメだよ、未来さん。\n明日、みんなにお土産渡すんでしょ？", "zh": "你可得好好起床哦，未来。明天不是要给大家送伴手礼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "905cc7c66a4f099f6c854944a753edb4720630749ee8bbe24ba64fe6d0d948ed", "ja": "あっ、そっか！　……うん！\nなんか、気合い入ってきたかも♪", "zh": "啊，对哦！……嗯！\n感觉好像越来越有干劲了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "bf6a7f741473cc137316360de8710828a706efaba8fce5e1cf97d4da78a81b5a", "ja": "桃子のほうが、未来の扱い方を\nよくわかってるみたいね。", "zh": "看来还是桃子更懂得该怎么对待未来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "542ffb09963c3350b38d089992ad01dcd92df44c44659d4ce3c067110fcf9d40", "ja": "ふふん。今回、一緒にツアーした仲だからね。\nこれくらいはお手の物だよ♪", "zh": "哼哼。这次我们可是一起巡演过的伙伴，这点小事当然难不倒我♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "ab135b24fd3f90055c7921e62629bdb4ba45737d3c8ac198a691f8fec60fa11c", "ja": "お～。このチームワークがあれば、\nきっと明日からも、問題なしですな～♪", "zh": "哦～有这样的团队合作精神，明天开始肯定也没问题啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_epi03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_epi03_1016_052kao", "source_sha256": "4aed23050c01d2a7c7aca57b68f559aa68717626b012e9d89f4c1e839e04bdb9", "ja": "ええ、本当に。\n明日からも、またよろしくね、みんな。", "zh": "嗯，确实如此。\n从明天开始也要继续拜托大家了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
